m/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1535a.jpg"}, {"id": 1916975, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc1535b.jpg"}], "slug": "raise-rise-and-die", "storyline": "Four humans have returned from the dead, bound to the souls they absorb. Each carries a past to uncover and a future yet to decide. In a dark fantasy world, they channel the power of these souls through their weapons to confront those who stand in their way.", "summary": "Raise, Rise & Die is a dark fantasy deckbuilder adapted from a physical card game. In solo Arena runs, players face automated enemy decks, collect new cards, and build synergies to climb the leaderboard.\nEvery card has a Soul Value that determines its cost to play, the Reserve it generates when sacrificed, and the health lost when it falls as the face-up Top Soul. Between battles, sacrificing cards from the deck restores health, creating a choice between preserving a powerful build and surviving the next encounter.\nThe game also features online one-on-one duels and Ancients\u2019 Path, an editor for creating and sharing custom runs.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/raise-rise-and-die", "videos": [{"id": 195473, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-SH_EFyrP8g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-SH_EFyrP8g", "title": "Raise, Rise & Die \u2014 Official Trailer | Dark fantasy deckbuilder duel", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-SH_EFyrP8g/sddefault.jpg"}]}